        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3708,  3\" Split Rope Bail Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Split Rope Bail Pull has an interesting design that picks up the highlights of the 5 available finishes. Perfect for use in the kitchen as well as in the bathroom or even on media stand doors, this cabinet door pull comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. It has a 3 inch center to center and a 3-3/4 inch overall length. Made by RK International, this bail pull with the rope design is a true classic with the beauty of tried and true designs to back it up.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3708 Traditional Split Rope Bail Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
